# Support

## Supported releases

List maintained versions and end-of-life dates here: **[SUPPORTED RELEASES]**.

## Where to get help

- Usage questions: **[DISCUSSION / SUPPORT URL]**
- Bugs: **[ISSUE TRACKER URL]**
- Security vulnerabilities: follow `SECURITY.md`; do not post public reports.
- Commercial support: **[SUPPORT CONTACT / SERVICE TERMS]**

## What to include

Provide version/commit, supported runtime/platform, minimal reproduction, sanitized logs, and expected vs actual behavior. Remove passwords, keys, access tokens, customer information, and other secrets.
